e customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060280/extras/002bb5203a32d3c1722db30108c05cde.avif?t=1759244455\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060280/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.poster.avif?t=1759244455\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060280/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.webm?t=1759244455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060280/extras/c0b8e6d178ee5b51b04699dbb9c2fa81.mp4?t=1759244455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand the hotel to have new rooms and rent them out. After guests check out, clean and tidy up the rooms. New customers will not want to stay because of messy rooms.</p>","developers":["Vovel Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3299080","name":"Snow Resort Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060280/c89ec951ec45b73761e8d510fc3be1d501c5d2ff/header.jpg?t=1759244455","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4060280/697877474/b387e46a231df8731b1950c679dea493c1bad0cb/1758723918/